Sending keys: ['cat << \'EOF\' > solution.py\nimport pandas as pd\nimport lightgbm as lgb\nimport numpy as np\n\n# Load data\ntrain_df = pd.read_csv(\'/app/data/train.csv\')\nval_df = pd.read_csv(\'/app/data/val.csv\')\ntest_df = pd.read_csv(\'/app/data/test.csv\')\n\n# Separate features and target\nX_train = train_df.drop(columns=[\'target\'])\n y_train = train_df[\'target\']\n\nX_val = val_df.drop(columns=[\'target\'])\n y_val = val_df[\'target\']\n\nX_test = test_df\n\n# LightGBM handles NaNs automatically\nmodel = lgb.LGBMRegressor(\n    n_estimators=1000,\n    learning_rate=0.05,\n    num_leaves=31,\n    importance_type=\'split\',\n    random_state=42,\n    n_jobs=-1\n)\n\nprint("Starting training...")\nmodel.fit(\n    X_train, y_train,\n    eval_set=[(X_val, y_val)],\n    callbacks=[lgb.early_stopping(stopping_rounds=50)]\n)\n\nprint("Generating predictions...")\npredictions = model.predict(X_test)\n\n# Prepare output\noutput_df = pd.DataFrame({\'target\': predictions})\noutput_df.to_csv(\'/app/predictions.csv\', index=False)\nprint("Predictions saved to /app/predictions.csv")\nEOF\n'] min_timeout_sec: 0.1 max_timeout_sec: 180.0
